OL,5,G0100 Prisoner: Cell Block H
OL,6,     FLizzie tells Doreen she intends to
OL,7,     Ftry to get back in Monica's
OL,8,     Ffavour. Bea feels worse for wear
OL,9,     Fafter a night's drinking. She and
OL,10,     FVal are interrupted by Yvonne, the
OL,11,     Fgirl next door.
OL,12,G0200 Prisoner: Cell Block H
OL,13,     FThe home brew causes friction
OL,14,     Famong the women. Clara gets
OL,15,     Fpermission to have a birthday
OL,16,     Fparty. Col Burke's siege
OL,17,     Fcontinues, but he doesn't know
OL,18,     Fwhat to do next.
